{"Test cleanup registration uses the literal string \"alias\" instead of the actual IDP alias (like \"idp-alias-0\", \"idp-alias-1\"), causing the test to not properly clean up created IDPs and potentially leading to test pollution": 0.9620864987373352, "The getForLogin method only checks isInvalid(cacheKey) but doesn't check if the organizationId parameter itself is invalidated, unlike getByOrganization which checks both isInvalid(cacheKey) and isInvalid(orgId), causing stale cached IDP data to be returned when an organization is modified or deleted": 0.8925008177757263}